    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<div class=\"control-header\" aria-hidden=\"false\">\n<div class=\"controls\">\n<div class=\"umb-property-editor db\">\n<div class=\"umb-property-editor umb-rte --initialized\">\n<div class=\"umb-rte-editor-con\">\n<p><strong>If your work relies on soil testing, this comprehensive guide is for you.</strong></p>\n<p>In this guide we will walk you through all the stages of soil testing for construction, showing you exactly what to expect and how each stage contributes to your success.<br><br></p>\n<p><em>On-Site Testing&nbsp; |&nbsp; Soil Sampling&nbsp; |&nbsp; </em><em>Soil Preparation&nbsp; |&nbsp; Soil Compaction&nbsp; |&nbsp; Plasticity Index (PI)&nbsp; |&nbsp; Shrinkage Limit&nbsp; |&nbsp; Plastic Limit&nbsp; |&nbsp; Liquid Limit&nbsp; |&nbsp; MODS&nbsp; |&nbsp; OMC&nbsp; |&nbsp; CBR&nbsp; |&nbsp; UCS&nbsp; |&nbsp; ITS&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
