    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "3ef5c851-77d2-46af-9a22-e2bfadd01829",
      "udi": "umb://element/893634e5cf1f45e3816d6a732af2fa2f",
      "title": "In-Laboratory Testing",
      "content": {
        "markup": "<p>In-lab asphalt testing offers precise, controlled analysis of asphalt materials, allowing for a deeper&nbsp;understanding of long-term performance, durability, and structural integrity.</p>\n<p>It verifies critical&nbsp;characteristics like binder content, air voids, and moisture, as well as sample stability and elasticity.</p>\n<p>Tests such as Rolling Thin Film Oven (RTFO), Bulk Density, and Elastic Recovery simulate real-world&nbsp;stresses and aging conditions.</p>\n<p>These insights guide decisions about mix design, compaction targets,<br>and material suitability.</p>\n<p>Laboratory testing ensures compliance with project specifications and industry standards, and&nbsp;provides documented proof of quality for handover or future auditing.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "images": [
        {
          "key": "facbd7b4-c5e8-4ed5-98e0-1bf98bdef1d2",
          "mediaKey": "cf3338ea-b4b3-4e4b-88b9-5306926fa368"
        }
      ],
      "anchorID": ""
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "3ef5c851-77d2-46af-9a22-e2bfadd01829",
      "udi": "umb://element/32ff01fb949e4d6d8ce65d7325cac892",
      "title": "Bitumen Testing",
      "content": {
        "markup": "<p>Bitumen tests measure the resilience, flexibility, and long-term performance of the asphalt binder and the paved surface.</p>\n<p>These assessments ensure that the surface can withstand traffic loads, resist deformation, and drain water effectively — all key indicators of road safety and durability.</p>\n<p>By understanding how the bitumen in a asphalt surface behaves, teams can prevent cracking, rutting, and early failure — ensuring the road delivers value over its expected lifespan.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "images": [
        {
          "key": "58383384-0693-4fcc-be46-0eee20f3bcd5",
          "mediaKey": "2aab3aa2-753d-4b14-92f5-e1152d83bc32"
        }
      ],
      "anchorID": ""
    }
  ],
